    "max_time_steps": 240,
    "description": "Level 3: node capacities used as a traffic meter - a corridor of waypoints with capacities 2, 1, 2 leading to a two-dock station, plus a 14-step bypass. Four units, eight pods. Punishes treating node capacity as a station-only feature: the capacity-1 middle waypoint serialises the whole fleet, and a unit that commits to the corridor while it is full simply burns steps at the junction instead of spending them on the bypass."
